---Creates UI positions and sizes.
---@class UDim2Library
UDim2 = {}

---A UI value from scale and pixel offset on each axis. Left-out components are 0.
---@param xScale? number
---@param xOffset? number
---@param yScale? number
---@param yOffset? number
---@return UDim2
function UDim2.new(xScale, xOffset, yScale, yOffset) end

